  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/2345678ijhvdrtyu.JPG\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 207px;\" /></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;be the point from which tangents are drawn.<br />So, combined equation of <math><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />where roots are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
